# scripts/opcount: `level bench dot N` runs N multiply-adds of a dot
# product, each product rounded; the cost of one is the slope between the
# two sizes (U3 CPU-LEVEL). Count it at GOAMD64=v1 and at GOAMD64=v3: the
# counts must match, as no level fuses a rounded product.
unit madd
sizes 4096000 24576000
args bench dot {n}
control benchmarks/level/testdata/control
binary level
